stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Ingested: adapter reads page / image
  Ingested --> Segmented: segment()
  Segmented --> Vectorized: rooms, doors, walls
  Vectorized --> Scaled
  state Scaled {
    [*] --> Estimated: door-width prior
    [*] --> Transferred: scale_like footprint
    [*] --> Measured: two-point evidence
    Estimated --> Measured: site measurements added, re-run
    Transferred --> Measured: site measurements added, re-run
  }
  Scaled --> GraphBuilt: graph + POIs
  GraphBuilt --> Validated: validate_floor()
  Validated --> Packaged: no errors
  Validated --> Rejected: errors (WALKABLE_EMPTY, EDGE_CROSSES_WALL, ...)
  Rejected --> Packaged: operator --force (flagged)
  Rejected --> Ingested: fix config / plan, re-run
  Packaged --> Imported: Android importer (M3)
  Imported --> Corrected: operator edits (planned)
  Corrected --> Imported: re-export, provenance = corrected
  Imported --> [*]
